---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About Samuel Mallo">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-black py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <p class="mb-4 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-green-500">
          // ABOUT
        </p>

        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
          About Samuel Mallo
        </h1>

        <div class="mt-6 h-px w-24 bg-green-500"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Introduction -->
      <article class="space-y-12">

        <section>
          <p class="text-xl leading-9 text-zinc-300">
            IT Security and Systems Technician with 4+ years of hands-on
            experience in cybersecurity threat monitoring, vulnerability
            assessment, endpoint security, and component-level hardware repair.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-zinc-400">
            Samuel Mallo is an IBM Certified Cybersecurity Analyst and IBM
            Certified AI Engineer, holding a TESDA Computer Systems Servicing
            NC II certification. His expertise spans incident response, threat
            intelligence, forensic data recovery, secure workstation
            deployment, and network fault diagnostics.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-zinc-400">
            Beyond technical skills, Samuel is a TESDA Gold Medalist in Graphic
            Design & Technology, bringing a unique combination of cybersecurity
            analysis, hardware technician support, and digital media production
            to his professional work.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Professional Background -->
        <section>
          <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-500">
            // BACKGROUND
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white md:text-3xl">
            Professional Background
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-zinc-400">
            Samuel's career began with hands-on technical support and hardware
            assembly, eventually evolving into specialized roles in IT security
            and systems support. He has worked across multiple industries
            including media broadcasting, educational institutions, and
            corporate IT environments.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Technical Interests -->
        <section>
          <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-500">
            // INTERESTS
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white md:text-3xl">
            Technical Interests
          </h2>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4">
            {[
              "Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning applications in cybersecurity",
              "Threat intelligence and incident response automation",
              "Computer vision and image processing",
              "Secure system architecture and hardening",
            ].map((interest) => (
              <li class="flex gap-3 leading-7 text-zinc-400">
                <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span>
                <span>{interest}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Career Direction -->
        <section>
          <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-500">
            // DIRECTION
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white md:text-3xl">
            Career Direction
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-zinc-400">
            Samuel is currently pursuing his Bachelor of Science in Computer
            Science at the University of the People while working full-time in
            IT security. His long-term goal is to bridge artificial intelligence
            and cybersecurity, developing intelligent systems that can
            proactively detect and respond to threats.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Education -->
        <section>
          <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-500">
            // EDUCATION
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white md:text-3xl">
            Education
          </h2>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-6">
            <li class="border-l-2 border-green-500/40 pl-5">
              <strong class="block text-white">
                Bachelor of Science in Computer Science
              </strong>
              <span class="text-zinc-500">(In Progress)</span>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-500">
                University of the People | 2023 - Present
              </p>
            </li>

            <li class="border-l-2 border-green-500/40 pl-5">
              <strong class="block text-white">
                Senior High School Diploma - Information & Communications
                Technology Track
              </strong>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-500">
                Vicente D. Trinidad National High School, Philippines |
                Graduated 2023
              </p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Languages -->
        <section>
          <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-500">
            // LANGUAGES
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white md:text-3xl">
            Languages
          </h2>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-zinc-400">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">English:</strong>
              C2 Proficient, EF SET Certified (76/100)
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Filipino:</strong>
              Native Proficiency
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Academic Courses -->
        <section>
          <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-500">
            // COURSES
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white md:text-3xl">
            Academic Courses
          </h2>

          <div class="mt-6 cyber-card p-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">
              CS50's Computer Science for Business Professionals
            </h3>

            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-500">
              Harvard University (HarvardX) | 2020
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>